      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i think i see what u mean about the ARN path. i'll check the prefixes. but man this is frustrating, it feels like no matter what i change, there's something hidden in the background just blocking the access. like i'm following the rules but there's still some weird barrier i can't see. what else could be acting as a hidden gatekeeper here?",
